{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"天氣報告｜大致多雲　下周中期氣溫再度下降\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/OBS-FORECAST-261121-07.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】東北季候風正影響廣東。同時，一道廣闊雲帶覆蓋沿岸地區。本港地區今日(11月21日)天氣預測，大致多雲及乾燥。日間部分時間有陽光，最高氣溫約21度。吹和緩至清勁偏北風，稍後轉吹東風。</p><p>展望未來一兩日大致多雲，風勢頗大，氣溫略為回升。下周中期氣溫再度下降。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T00:09:33.858797+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T23:10:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T20:41:25.193157+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T00:03:04.435414+00:00","content_hash":"60f3bd4920139cd4b4cf01b400923728ac9e5102b72f711ddbcd913f24cd14d5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}